{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/wish_english.png?t=1751024510\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to our hotel, where anyone could be a guest. Ghost? Ancient deity? Character from a famous fairy tale? But the staff here is not so ordinary either.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/2.gif?t=1751024510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From now on, you are a new employee of this hotel. A friendly team and interesting tasks to keep you waiting for more. Your job description? Be ready to become a jack of all trades!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/3.gif?t=1751024510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everybody here has their own story, everybody has a skeleton in their closet (apart from Jeff from room 7 - because he is the skeleton). Learn more about the scary fairytales within the walls of the most friendly hotel in all the worlds!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/1.gif?t=1751024510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And keep in mind: the most important thing is to pass the probationary period. From there on, it will definitely get easier!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join in the hotel</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check-in: choose a suitable room, according to the preferences and special requests of the guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Room Service: deliver food, run errands, and help with guests' hotel-related problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conflict management: resolve disputes between guests or employees, this will affect their attitude towards you and each other.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactivity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guest engagement: requests range from cooking unique meals (e.g. custom potion orders) to helping find lost items (or even guests!) in rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entertainment activities: dinner with visitors and staff, weekend adventures with friends, opportunities to be a photographer and gather a sticker collection.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social interactions</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developing relationships with your colleagues, from platonic to romantic. Each character has its own story. How each character story reveals - depends only on you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The decisions that you make during the working day determine not only the story, but also the ending of the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings depend on how you fulfill your duties, your relationships, and your key choices in certain moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diversity of endings: romantic outcomes, revealing the secrets of the hotel, or even its destruction (if everything goes wrong). Experience them all! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/wishlist_english.png?t=1751024510\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413800?t=1751024510","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3