acter story reveals - depends only on you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The decisions that you make during the working day determine not only the story, but also the ending of the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings depend on how you fulfill your duties, your relationships, and your key choices in certain moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diversity of endings: romantic outcomes, revealing the secrets of the hotel, or even its destruction (if everything goes wrong). Experience them all! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/wishlist_english.png?t=1751024510\" /></div></p>","developers":["TopHouse Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/header.jpg?t=1751024510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098598,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098598/movie480.mp4?t=1739617572","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098598/movie_max.mp4?t=1739617572"},"name":"Teaser Trailer (ENG)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098598/894cc50ebdc3ca059d7840311e3dee53c67492f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739617572","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098598/movie480